{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497650/extras/te_staempage.png?t=1744387513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immerse</strong> yourself in a <u><strong>fortress building simulator</strong></u> with elements of <u><strong>turn-based strategy</strong></u> and <u><strong>real-time strategy</strong></u> in our new game Tiny Europe! <br> <br><strong>Dark forces do not sleep!</strong> You have miraculously survived on the bizarre continent of Europe, but this is just the beginning. You have to build a fortress in <u><i>60 seconds</i></u>, until the first enemy attack begins. Everything you manage to build in <u><i>60 seconds</i></u> will be free for you. After <u><i>60 seconds</i></u> have passed, you need to defend against waves of enemies, grow food, build walls, hire troops. Your task is to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497650/extras/te_staempage_3.png?t=1744387513\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Build and survive</i>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>8 types of buildings</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 types of opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique graphics style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We alternate between relaxation and tension!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 types of defensive troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497650/extras/te_staempage_4.png?t=1744387513\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497650/extras/te_staempage_2.png?t=1744387513\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First camp!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat